      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Continuation of increased-take-home-pay plan during 1968-69 fiscal year, for City-paid officers and employees who are members of City-supported retirement systems and additional provisions relating to the period June first, nineteen hundred sixty-eight through June thirtieth, nineteen hundred sixty-nine for sanitationmen.",
